		"startIntroPart1": "Alhemin awoke with a start, his body aching from the cold, hard ground beneath him. As he opened his eyes, he found himself in a strange, bioluminescent world. The air was thick with the scent of mushrooms and the distant sounds of unknown creatures. He had no memory of how he got there, but he knew one thing for certain: he had to survive.

