		"adjective": ["Crystal Isles"],
		"startBias": ["Beach"],
		"preferredVictoryType":"Domination",

		"startIntroPart1": "Joana, a former graduated woman, finds herself mysteriously transported to the vibrant and treacherous Crystal Isles. The landscape is unlike anything she has ever seen, with floating islands, bioluminescent caves, and crystalline structures that shimmer in the sunlight. Joana quickly realizes that survival here will require all her wits and skills. She forms a bond with a Tropeognathus, after saving it from a flock of aggressive Wyverns. Together, they explore the floating islands, uncovering ancient secrets and battling hostile tribes that seek to control the island’s unique resources. Joana’s journey is one of discovery and resilience, as she learns to harness the power of the crystals and the unique flora and fauna of the Crystal Isles to survive and thrive.",
		"startIntroPart2": "",

		"declaringWar": "I'm so sorry hun, I´m not perfect.",
		"attacked": "Ouch, are you out of your mind?!",
		"defeated": "Everything turns dark...",
		"introduction": "hello! I'm Joana~",

		"neutralHello": "Hello darling!",
		"hateHello": "Ugh, why are you such a meanie?",

