		"personality": "Helena Walker",
		"adjective": ["Genesis"],
		"startBias": ["Plains"],
		"preferredVictoryType":"Domination",

		"startIntroPart1": "HLN-A, or Helena, is an artificial intelligence entity created by Dr. Helena Walker, one of the original survivors in the ARK universe. Helena Walker was a brilliant biologist who, after surviving the trials of the ARKs, ascended to a higher plane of existence. In her new form, she created HLN-A to assist other survivors.

HLN-A is designed to be a guide and companion for players, providing them with crucial information, mission briefings, and support throughout their journey in the Genesis Simulation. She embodies Helena’s personality, including her curiosity, intelligence, and compassion, making her more than just a robotic assistant. HLN-A’s primary role is to help players understand and navigate the complex environments and challenges they face, from hostile creatures to intricate puzzles.

Throughout the game, HLN-A offers insights into the lore of the ARK universe, revealing bits of Helena’s own story and the broader narrative of the ARKs. She also helps players by marking mission objectives, offering tips, and even providing some comic relief with her witty remarks.

HLN-A’s presence is a constant reminder of Helena Walker’s legacy and her efforts to ensure the survival and success of future generations of survivors. Her guidance is invaluable as players strive to uncover the mysteries of the Genesis Simulation and ultimately, the true purpose of the ARKs.",
